    <guid isPermaLink="false">6820bb5db7c8a9962c8e31d7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 May 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>快听我！你将收获一期陪伴超久且充满欢声笑语的夏日特辑！专属于女生的快乐！小宝当妈妈了以后，变得更活泼了呢，期待下一次串台呀么么哒～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期你将听到：（感谢小宝的shownotes，抄作业啦）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:00:20</a> 第一次串台，欢迎「双城FM」！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">00:01:20</a> 每个双人播客都有一个催更的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">00:02:17</a> 冬人or 夏人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">00:06:25</a> 少吃荔枝，争做铁血老太</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">00:07:35</a> 冰淇淋小妹好赚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">00:10:05</a> 夏天里的100件幸福小事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">00:30:05</a> 谁还没有点睡眠问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">00:44:35</a> 夏热没胃口？喝点养生茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">00:53:00</a> 当代人脆皮养生之吃补剂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> 铁血老太，压力卸载</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4335">01:12:15</a> 养儿不防老，防晒才防老</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">01:20:00</a> 夏日好物推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5480">01:31:20</a> 适合夏日追的剧和综艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5820">01:37:00</a> 果然不能在摩羯座面前瞎说八道啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>附上「夏天可以做的100件幸福小事」清单，来自小红书账号@Hug yourself</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjHQx0Dz99TY25xnY-YHjQDhWaBX.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhStnvNDSGhiMm1Fm-k1VXCjGak3.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>这是《靠谱姐姐》第三季前的夏日特辑，和双城FM合作录制，希望大家喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一季的我们尝试去探讨「让30+焦虑的9个人生问题」这样的宏观叙事，第二季的我们更多地缩小命题，轻松闲聊，陪伴大家一起讨论一些在个体感受上的，微观的，每天在发生却忘了被展开聊聊的生活小经历、小观察。希望在第三季，可以给大家带来更多有用有益的信息和经验。祝好，比心～</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家的支持和收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎点赞、留言、收藏我们的节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>-❤️-</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>杏里【Windy Summer】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卢广仲【最寂寞的时候】</span></p><span></span><p><span>伍佰&amp;China Blue【夏夜晚风】</span></p><span></span><p><span>孙燕姿【一样的夏天】</span></p><span></span><p><span>莫文蔚【盛夏的果实】</span></p><span></span><p><span>李玖哲【夏天】</span></p><span></span><p><span>BAAD【君が好きだと叫びたい】</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里也可以找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：@苏靠谱 @真真GoodgirlJJ</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站：@靠谱不加糖（停更但也欢迎来参观哦～）</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入我们的听友群：_sukaopu_</span></p>]]></description>
